After being found and brought back by her wealthy family, Arabella Donovan has an unexpected awakening and discovers that the world she lives in is a mishmash of popular story tropes.
Her eldest brother is the tragic guy in a melodramatic, angsty novel;
Her second brother is the cannon fodder in an showbiz power-fantasy novel;
Her third brother is the scapegoat who ends up with a criminal record in a doting teen romance;
Her fourth sister is the vicious villainess in a 'real vs. fake heiress' story;
And even her parents are just antagonistic background characters in some sweet, middle-aged romance.
Arabella Donovan: This family is a complete collection of misfortunes. The word 'tragic' doesn't even begin to cover it.
